{"title":"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A picture <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> feet across is hung in the center of a wall that is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/b/efbfe273946ff9f971c5eab331ca39caa6fdf7f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> feet wide.  How many feet from the end of the wall is the nearest edge of the picture?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/5/06543de1b7c1eeee3f2a967e0eea1f8a1cbdf047.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 1\\frac{1}{2} \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 8 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 9\\frac{1}{2} \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 16 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 22$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"374\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The wall is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/b/efbfe273946ff9f971c5eab331ca39caa6fdf7f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> feet wide and the picture is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> feet wide, the uncovered parts of the wall total <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> feet in width.  Since there is the same amount of empty space on each side of the picture, there is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/3/2e3325f13f86b7b46d140035880e63718ba743a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16 \\div 2 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"130\" height=\"30\" /> feet of space on each side of the picture.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be the distance in feet between an edge of the wall and the nearest edge of the picture. Since there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> feet on both sides of picture, the total width of the wall is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/a/eba8dac1bf22e3296ffa74f19d61beff35bbe662.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x + 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"50\" height=\"14\" /> feet.  So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/8/aa884538cdeabd07989d91504054924018fbbeff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x + 3 = 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"95\" height=\"15\" /> and therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/3/c238ad25633df8ef40b654011d1832f16782edec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"91\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME\" title=\"1986 AJHSME\">1986 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1986\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1